### ============================================================
###  PE1 — EmployeeService (/api/employees) — có Feign sang Department
###  Status map: 1=OK  2=validation  4=not found  0=500
###  Response KHÔNG có field departmentId (write-only), chỉ có department nested.
### ============================================================

### 01. Create employee — departmentId dạng PHẲNG
# Expect: 201, status=1, data.status="ACTIVE", data.department nested (departmentId=2), KHÔNG có field departmentId ở root
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Pham Van Test",
  "email": "test1@fpt.edu.vn",
  "position": "Developer",
  "startDate": "01/07/2026",
  "departmentId": 2
}

### 02. Create employee — department NESTED (shape đúng spec)
# Expect: 201, status=1
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Thi Nested",
  "email": "test2@fpt.edu.vn",
  "position": "Staff",
  "startDate": "2026-07-15",
  "department": { "departmentId": 3 }
}

### 03. Create — departmentId không tồn tại (Feign verify)
# Expect: 400, status=4, "Department ID is not found"
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ghost Dept Employee",
  "email": "ghost@fpt.edu.vn",
  "position": "Manager",
  "startDate": "01/07/2026",
  "departmentId": 99999
}

### 04. Create — thiếu departmentId hoàn toàn
# Expect: 400, status=2, "departmentId is required"
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "No Dept",
  "email": "nodept@fpt.edu.vn",
  "position": "Staff",
  "startDate": "01/07/2026"
}

### 05. Create — thiếu startDate (NotNull)
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "No StartDate",
  "email": "nostart@fpt.edu.vn",
  "position": "Staff",
  "departmentId": 2
}

### 06. Create — position ngoài enum Manager|Developer|Staff
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bad Position",
  "email": "badpos@fpt.edu.vn",
  "position": "Intern",
  "startDate": "01/07/2026",
  "departmentId": 2
}

### 07. Create — email sai format
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bad Email",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "position": "Staff",
  "startDate": "01/07/2026",
  "departmentId": 2
}

### 08. Create — startDate sai format
# Expect: 400, status=2 ("Request body is invalid")
POST {{detailUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bad Date",
  "email": "baddate@fpt.edu.vn",
  "position": "Staff",
  "startDate": "July 1st 2026",
  "departmentId": 2
}

### 09. Get detail — id có sẵn trong init_db.sql
# Expect: 200, status=1, data.department nested, startDate dạng dd/MM/yyyy
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/1

### 10. Get detail — không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4, "Employee is not found"
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/99999

### 11. Update — partial: chỉ đổi position
# Expect: 200, status=1, chỉ position đổi
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "position": "Manager"
}

### 12. Update — đổi phòng ban (Feign verify lại)
# Expect: 200, status=1, data.department.departmentId=2
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentId": 2
}

### 13. Update — sang department không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4, "Department ID is not found"
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentId": 99999
}

### 14. Update — status ngoài enum ACTIVE|LEFT|RETIRED|INACTIVE
# Expect: 400, status=2
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "FIRED"
}

### 15. Update — id không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
PUT {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ghost"
}

### 16. Deactivate (soft delete)
# Expect: 200, status=1; get lại id=3 thấy status="INACTIVE"
DELETE {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/3

### 17. Deactivate — không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
DELETE {{detailUrl}}/api/employees/99999

### 18. List — mặc định
# Expect: 200, status=1, PageDTO; mỗi phần tử content có department nested
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees

### 19. List — phân trang
# Expect: 200, size=2, page=0
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees?page=0&size=2

### 20. List — filter name partial
# Expect: 200, content chỉ người có "Nguyen" trong fullName
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees?name=Nguyen

### 21. List — filter status
# Expect: 200, content toàn LEFT
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees?status=LEFT

### 22. List — status không hợp lệ
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees?status=WRONG

### 23. List — size vượt 100
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{detailUrl}}/api/employees?size=200
